6-501.12 Floors were soiled in the cafe in the following locations:
1. Under the reach-in cooler beneath the espresso machine (single service/debris);
2. Along the west wall beneath the service counter (single service/debris);
3. Along east wall adjacent to display case (single service/general debris); 
4. Corner beneath the oven counter (debris/mouse dropping); and 
5. Under ice machine and floor drain (single service/debris/mold).
Clean the floors throughout the cafe under equipment. Clean and disinfect the floor where rodent activity was observed.
Physical facilities shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean.

4-602.13 The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
1. Bottom inside storage freezer in cafe (food debris); 
2. Bottom inside far left freezer in back store room (general debris/food crumbs); 
3. Counter under equipment near the front handwashing sink (coffee beans/general debris); 
4. Outer surfaces of freezers and cooler in back store room (splash); and
5. General surfaces of storage cooler in cafe (splash/crumbs). 
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
